   "text": "Open bins with picture labels really help younger kids. They can see where everything goes without reading.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, something else. I keep dying at the same boss and I'm about to give up.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
   "block": "video_games.ctx3",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Frustrating. Do you want some tips on beating it, or would you rather turn the difficulty down and enjoy the story?",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.35,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.ctx3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "You got a second? It's important.",
